msgctxt "56"
msgid "Banking:\\r\nBefore playing, you must decide who goes first."
msgstr "Tiro de banda:\nAntes de jugar, se debe decidir que jugador va primero."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "68"
msgid "Each player strikes the cue ball. The player whose ball stops closest to them, goes first."
msgstr "Cada jugador golpea la bola. El jugador que logre que la bola quede más cerca de él, va primero."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "80"
msgid "However, the ball must hit the opposing cushion once in order to be counted."
msgstr "Pero la bola debe golpear la banda contraria para que sea contada."

